model_bridge.py is the project adaptation of the fixed BirdNET-Pi/BirdNET-Lite
model-function interface and is distributed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
The adaptation selects eight upstream functions, redirects configured file
paths and binds analysis to explicit recording metadata; it preserves the
upstream scoring algorithm. The project contributions are by Researchers.

vendor/server.py and vendor/labels.txt retain their upstream terms. The complete
pinned BirdNET-Pi/BirdNET-Lite licence and accompanying third-party notices are
preserved without modification in vendor/LICENSE. That file credits the
K. Lisa Yang Center for Conservation Bioacoustics, Cornell Lab of Ornithology,
Cornell University, and Patrick McGuire, and states CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for
BirdNET-Lite/BirdNET-Pi. Do not interpret a licence paragraph for an accompanying
component as relicensing the complete BirdNET source or model interface.

Upstream: https://github.com/mcguirepr89/BirdNET-Pi
Commit: 6334367ac0257514967025487026d6fe6b351afe

External model weights, Python packages, ALSA and FFmpeg binaries are not
redistributed here and retain their own terms. The MIT licence applies only
to the original material identified above; it does not replace the upstream
